                                "sense_id": "434167e1-8f4a-3999-9edb-b577008b96ee",
                                "text": "A novel abusive word for a resident of Lugansk \"Lugan-don/Lugansk-condom\" can be explained as either an agglutination of the two words \"Lugansk\" + \"condom\" or as a reference to a mythological country \"Luganda\" whose name comprises component \"Lugansk\" and \"Uganda\"."
